WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.892
Multiple CTEs can depend on earlier CTEs This
creates

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:12.584
a pipeline The first stage summarizes admissions The

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:18.394
second stage joins those counts to patient
attributes The final query

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:24.128
creates a visit-pattern label Each stage has one
focused job and one

00:00:24.154 --> 00:00:25.273
explainable grain
